    dc:type "resolution-route/computation";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Run one fixed cellular-automaton rule from multiple configurations and classify resulting backgrounds, particles, and interactions. Distinct reproducible collective behaviors under the identical local rule confirm the existence claim.";
